OL,3,AMore than 30 children killed in
OL,4,APakistan school roof collapse as owner
OL,5,Aarrested
OL,6,
OL,7,FA local official says emergency
OL,8,Fservices were first alerted to the
OL,9,Fincident at the private Al-Khair school
OL,10,Fin the Dir Colony neighbourhood at
OL,11,F08:48 local time (04:48 BST) - here's a
OL,12,Fmap of the area
OL,14,FRescue workers and residents searched
OL,15,Fthe rubble for hours, concerned more
OL,16,Fchildren could be trapped
OL,18,FOur reporter there says rescuers
OL,19,Fstruggled to get the injured out as the
OL,20,Fschool is in a narrow street where only
OL,21,Fone vehicle can pass at a time
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
